OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor pool closed after sewage
OL,4,Aoverflow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bathing pool has been closed "with
OL,7,Fimmediate effect" following a leak from
OL,8,Fthe site's toilets.
OL,10,FThe States of Guernsey said it had been
OL,11,Fdirected by Environmental Health to
OL,12,Fclose the Ladies Pool at La Vallette
OL,13,Fafter tests revealed foul drainage from
OL,14,Fthe toilets had been found in public
OL,15,Fareas and the pool.
OL,17,FThe Bathing Pools, the charity which
OL,18,Foversees the site said the cesspit that
OL,19,Fserved both the public toilets and cafe
OL,20,Fhad "overfilled".
